1
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:08,008
Dodo: Hi, little explorers! I'm Dodo!

2
00:00:08,258 --> 00:00:11,689
Dini: And I'm Dini! Dino-hello!

3
00:00:12,539 --> 00:00:18,519
Dodo: Welcome to the rainbow garden. But oh no! Everything is grey!

4
00:00:18,769 --> 00:00:20,805
Dini: Where did all the colors go?

5
00:00:21,055 --> 00:00:25,060
Dodo: Let's find six colorful things and bring the colors back!

6
00:00:26,210 --> 00:00:28,351
Dini: Look! A blue apple!

7
00:00:28,601 --> 00:00:31,843
Dodo: Not quite, Dini. This apple is red!

8
00:00:32,093 --> 00:00:34,339
Dodo: Red! Can you say red?

9
00:00:36,439 --> 00:00:39,735
Dini: Red! Red like a yummy apple!

10
00:00:40,585 --> 00:00:42,818
Dodo: Can you find something red near you?

11
00:00:46,418 --> 00:00:48,212
Dodo: What is floating up there?

12
00:00:48,462 --> 00:00:50,934
Dini: A balloon! Is it yellow?

13
00:00:51,184 --> 00:00:54,678
Dodo: No, silly! What color is the balloon?

14
00:00:56,778 --> 00:00:59,968
Dodo: It's blue! Blue like the sky!

15
00:01:00,218 --> 00:01:02,940
Dini: Blue! Dino-wow!

16
00:01:04,090 --> 00:01:08,279
Dini: Something is shining! Ooh, a green star!

17
00:01:08,529 --> 00:01:11,783
Dodo: Try again, Dini. The star is yellow!

18
00:01:12,033 --> 00:01:13,637
Dodo: Can you say yellow?

19
00:01:15,737 --> 00:01:19,265
Dini: Yellow! Yellow like the sunshine!

20
00:01:20,415 --> 00:01:22,158
Dodo: Look, a little leaf!

21
00:01:22,408 --> 00:01:23,581
Dini: Is it purple?

22
00:01:23,831 --> 00:01:27,522
Dodo: No, it's green! Just like you, Dini!

23
00:01:27,772 --> 00:01:30,570
Dini: Green like me! Hooray!

24
00:01:30,820 --> 00:01:33,623
Dodo: Which thing is green? The leaf!

25
00:01:35,623 --> 00:01:39,457
Dini: Mmm, a round fruit! Is it red?

26
00:01:40,307 --> 00:01:45,223
Dodo: Close! This is an orange, and its color is orange too!

27
00:01:45,473 --> 00:01:46,903
Dodo: Say orange!

28
00:01:49,003 --> 00:01:52,235
Dini: Orange! Like your sneakers, Dodo!

29
00:01:53,385 --> 00:01:55,076
Dodo: One more color to find!

30
00:01:55,326 --> 00:01:58,137
Dini: A pretty flower! Is it blue?

31
00:01:58,387 --> 00:02:01,217
Dodo: Almost! This flower is purple!

32
00:02:01,467 --> 00:02:02,959
Dodo: Can you say purple?

33
00:02:05,059 --> 00:02:07,660
Dini: Purple! I love purple!

34
00:02:08,810 --> 00:02:12,414
Dodo: We found all six colors! Look at the garden!

35
00:02:12,664 --> 00:02:15,348
Dini: The rainbow is back! Hooray!

36
00:02:16,498 --> 00:02:21,274
Dodo: Let's play a color game! I show a thing, you shout the color!

37
00:02:21,524 --> 00:02:23,086
Dodo: What color is this?

38
00:02:24,986 --> 00:02:25,769
Dini: Blue!

39
00:02:26,269 --> 00:02:27,831
Dodo: What color is this?

40
00:02:29,731 --> 00:02:30,531
Dini: Red!

41
00:02:31,031 --> 00:02:32,594
Dodo: What color is this?

42
00:02:34,494 --> 00:02:35,314
Dini: Green!

43
00:02:35,814 --> 00:02:37,376
Dodo: What color is this?

44
00:02:39,276 --> 00:02:40,040
Dini: Purple!

45
00:02:40,540 --> 00:02:42,103
Dodo: What color is this?

46
00:02:44,003 --> 00:02:44,720
Dini: Yellow!

47
00:02:45,220 --> 00:02:46,782
Dodo: What color is this?

48
00:02:48,682 --> 00:02:49,527
Dini: Orange!

49
00:02:50,927 --> 00:02:53,571
Dodo: Can you remember all six colors?

50
00:02:57,171 --> 00:03:00,881
Dodo: Wow! We learned six beautiful colors today!

51
00:03:01,131 --> 00:03:05,513
Dini: Red, blue, yellow, green, orange and purple! Dino-wow!

52
00:03:06,663 --> 00:03:10,033
Dodo: Share this video with a friend who loves colors!

53
00:03:10,283 --> 00:03:12,848
Dodo & Dini: See you next time, little explorers!

